{"id":1701,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为扎实推进专业建设与工程教育认证工作，4月3日学院组织全体管理人员开展工程认证专题学习活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLz9UiUznko77ionln7olrkM7CbozrS2nmliL49YM4nfM4N0gihFp2hmCIa0nkysnkysMSyPnR62nNLanNr2ozGZM7CZL4f7M8UaLzNiMRAFnNC8MR7DL4AFM7MVM87Jqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-bozlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22995&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D7D751D7FFC0FEF9084F830D7D019548/FF441638/4CE7A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLz9UiUznko77ionln7olrkM7CbozrS2nmliL49YM4nfM4N0gihFp2hmCIa0nkysnkysMSyPnR62nNLanNr2ozGZM7CZL4f7M8UaLzNiMRAFnNC8MR7DL4AFM7MVM87Jqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-bozlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22995&e=.jpg\"></p><p>学习围绕工程教育认证标准、OBE 理念内涵、自评报告撰写、持续改进机制建设等核心内容展开，系统解读认证流程与关键要求。与会人员结合学院专业发展实际，就如何对标认证指标、优化培养方案、强化质量保障等方面进行交流讨论。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLz9UsMNCsMR6VMnmvPnz-8nzGPoRGSDUz7YLNCiLNCsnmC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybMSyDMSh2LzA7nRW2nzM2Mz7iU8MfL8Uso7UYUmLbU8VFnm-ZUN7ZUm6FMRARnmCJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-bozlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22995&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F9565F18DD2FE3F515CCA3D78D2B39CA/F28BA8B7/48CF6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLz9UsMNCsMR6VMnmvPnz-8nzGPoRGSDUz7YLNCiLNCsnmC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybMSyDMSh2LzA7nRW2nzM2Mz7iU8MfL8Uso7UYUmLbU8VFnm-ZUN7ZUm6FMRARnmCJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-bozlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22995&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次学习进一步统一了思想认识，提升了管理人员对工程认证工作的理解与把握，为学院有序推进专业认证、提升人才培养质量奠定了坚实基础。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ece.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLz9UiUznko77ionln7olrkM7CbozrS2nmliL49YM4nfM4N0gihFp2hmCIa0nkysnkysMSyPnR62nNLanNr2ozGZM7CZL4f7M8UaLzNiMRAFnNC8MR7DL4AFM7MVM87Jqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-bozlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22995&e=.jpg"}